: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza a Meia Maratona de Bilbau 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>17 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida noturna marcada para as <strong>19h00<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde fica a partida e chegada da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A partida monumental situa-se junto \u00e0 esplanada do <strong>Museu Guggenheim Bilbao<\/strong> e a meta na zona ribeirinha da Ria de Bilbau.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento integra tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias noturnas: a <strong>Meia Maratona (21.097 km)<\/strong>, a <strong>Corrida 10 km<\/strong> e a <strong>Maratona (42.195 km)<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O percurso \u00e9 plano e r\u00e1pido?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, o tra\u00e7ado \u00e9 totalmente plano em asfalto citadino ao n\u00edvel da ria, homologado pela federa\u00e7\u00e3o e ideal para bater recordes pessoais.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma oficial do <a href=\"https:\/\/www.bilbaonightrun.com\/en-gb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bilbao Night Run<\/a>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona de Bilbau 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-17\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Museu Guggenheim Bilbao, Bilbau\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Bilbau\", \"addressRegion\": \"Espanha\", \"addressCountry\": \"ES\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Streetblaster e Ayuntamiento de Bilbao\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza a Meia Maratona de Bilbau 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 17 de Outubro de 2026 , com partida noturna marcada para as 19h00 .\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde fica a partida e chegada da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A partida monumental situa-se junto \u00e0 esplanada do Museu Guggenheim Bilbao e a meta na zona ribeirinha da Ria de Bilbau.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento integra tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias noturnas: a Meia Maratona (21.097 km) , a Corrida 10 km e a Maratona (42.195 km) .\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O percurso \u00e9 plano e r\u00e1pido?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, o tra\u00e7ado \u00e9 totalmente plano em asfalto citadino ao n\u00edvel da ria, homologado pela federa\u00e7\u00e3o e ideal para bater recordes pessoais.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma oficial do Bilbao Night Run .\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66252,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,28,31,41],"event_type_2":[809,627],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-47344","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-bilbau-espanha","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-maratona","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-espanha","event_type_2-europa"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/meia-maratona-de-bilbau-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/47344",